# ── 가중치·라이선스 제한 파일 (공개 저장소에 올리면 안 됨) ──────────────────
# AnyHand/WiLoR 체크포인트: CC-BY-NC-ND (비상업·연구 한정)
# MANO_RIGHT.pkl: MPI MANO 라이선스상 재배포 금지
# → README.md §2 안내대로 각자 원본(HF, mano.is.tue.mpg.de)에서 받아 배치할 것
models/*.ckpt
models/*.pt
mano_data/*.pkl
mano_data/*.bak

# ── 대용량 샘플·생성 결과물 (용량만 크고 재현 가능) ──────────────────────────
samples/*.mp4
out/

# ── 파이썬 가상환경 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# ── 캐시 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── OS / 에디터 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Camera research datasets / caches ───────────────────────────────────────
experiments/datasets/
experiments/cache/

# Large per-run artifacts
experiments/runs/**/artifacts/
experiments/runs/**/tmp/
# Safety net: dataset archives / videos must never be committed from anywhere
experiments/**/*.zip
experiments/**/*.tar
experiments/**/*.tar.gz
experiments/**/*.tgz
experiments/**/*.7z
experiments/datasets/**
experiments/**/*.mp4

# Per-run inference caches (large, regenerable by re-running the pipeline)
experiments/runs/**/cache/
# Pipeline inference environment (torch + numpy<2), kept out of the analysis venv
experiments/.venv-anyhand/

# Calibration-model inference environment (CAM-EXP-003)
experiments/.venv-calib/

# AnyCam applicability testing environment (CAM-EXP-004.1); its official
# inference path cannot run on Windows, see that run's anycam_static_stress_test.md
experiments/.venv-anycam/
